#: src/gisheh/onboarding.py:84
msgid ""
"Keep films, shows and anime in one calm, native library built for the GNOME "
"desktop. Browse with TMDB metadata, track titles, seasons and episodes, and "
"use your GNOME accent colour. Your library stays yours: Gisheh can work "
"entirely on this device, or keep your watch activity synchronized through "
"Simkl. Local-first never requires an account, Simkl connects through a "
"browser PIN instead of your password, and TMDB supplies catalog details and "
"artwork. You can change this later."
msgstr ""

